  "note": "Curated toolkit skills per build workflow. 'source' is a directory under SKILLS_SOURCE_DIR containing SKILL.md; it is copied to <workspace>/.claude/skills/<name>/ and the name is passed to query({ options: { skills } }). Set 'sha256' to the hex SHA-256 of a skill's SKILL.md to pin an exact reviewed version. A missing REQUIRED skill or tool fails the job at preflight.",
